  50:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     * Per-Pin APIs if you wish to control individual pin's drive modes.
  51:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *
  52:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     * <b>Note</b> USBIOs have limited drive functionality. Refer to the Drive Mode
  53:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     * parameter for more information.
  54:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *
  55:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     * \param mode
  56:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  Mode for the selected signals. Valid options are documented in 
  57:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  \ref driveMode.
  58:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *
  59:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     * \return
  60:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  None
