  65:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  and performs writes to the Pins component Drive Mode registers can cause 
  66:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  corrupted port data. To avoid this issue, you should either use the Per-Pin
  67:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/I2C_CFG.c ****     *  APIs (primary method) or disable interrupts around this function.
